{
  "iri": "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_66964",
  "lang": "en",
  "description": [
    "A diterpenoid that is 6a,7,8,10a-tetrahydro-6<em>H</em>-benzo[<em>c</em>]chromene substituted at position 1 by a hydroxy group, positions 6, 6 and 9 by methyl groups and at position 3 by a pentyl group. The principal psychoactive constituent of the cannabis plant, it is used for treatment of anorexia associated with AIDS as well as nausea and vomiting associated with cancer chemotherapy."
  ],
